==Description==
The '''EvilHacker Nametag''' is a {{Color|Rare}} nametag that can be bought in the daily nametag store for {{Coins|5,000}}.

The '''EvilHacker Nametag''' has pink text with a dark purple gradient outline. Behind the text, black waves and a pink grid can be seen. Multiple 0 and 1s are emitted from the nametag.

